  "guidance_candidates": [
    {
      "text": "Identify essential, dynamic content that people want to view at a glance",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "3a07a53bfed76c3af73f00e55b1e585019740f6bf0f7f0afcd3e4386685c24ae",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Support all complication families when possible",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "ec65e92a6a8e88e1f69746068f3e2e20acc74f18101dfc8fbb794c570fcdb18f",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider creating multiple complications for each family",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b2c301ae1e7d0e462191db94a30dc1fce5022b1daaa468da171ee370ee8df6aa",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Define a different deep link for each complication you support",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "0fdca55704357567e12ebf84efa7538ee6538d830a9d5c312cdd208bfff1dab6",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep privacy in mind",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "33749ad7a4b9d03aa2976ae7c0931f8ba7f63b8a02347e7591c34d9c540eae52",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully consider when to update data",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "7af0ae8a72eedbc225fa872d25eba222e6c9d1e44b722e11f64f6c3224507057",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose a ring or gauge style based on the data you need to display",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Visual design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "40a709cc4ea1e1502b4592f795d7963ee4be6a0a135c98ca33e3731d3db8462e",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "The closed style can convey a value that’s a percentage of a whole, such as for a battery gauge",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Visual design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "81882edd94cd72770fccaddbf6a9a72a81bf50ec9cc82715245e90ff769528b6",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "The open style works well when the minimum and maximum values are arbitrary — or don’t represent a percentage",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Visual design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5992c0e61fd5bffe097347c7d4176dc19a0bd7e9bbbd6fe10085486897d258a5",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Similar to the open style, the segmented style also displays values within an app-defined range, and can convey rapid",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Visual design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "d2c8d389ffa7b24c252d984c0d3763b66fed079b3f67006991414776cf71f960",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sure images look good in tinted mode",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Visual design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "a5b97b31f482c75907fd3fba9cbf5937d311366f0480db440b89b80c228fbea7",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid using color as the only way to communicate important information. You want people to get the same information",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Visual design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c95a9e9d8b4f4b31e43ecb048182ed6e98328b91cb422b2cc0c252c6560ddedc",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "When necessary, provide an alternative tinted-mode version of a full-color image. If your full-color image doesn’t look good when",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Visual design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "afa3013b27eec74a708727b995082a4ae559bb57f14fd8bee99e8c0d766823e6",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Recognize that people might prefer to use tinted mode for complications, instead of viewing them in full color",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Visual design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8cc1445c7bc3001d714032489db18a0b336efdbb0fbade0fb12d34463ce1e498",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "When creating complication content, generally use line widths of two points or greater",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Visual design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "a216df599a0dc54afc28dc7ed289648d03d56a8b19c45308f512f9be6d68378c",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Provide a set of static placeholder images for each complication you support",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Visual design"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "31265aca5400107665740ad5834bf31eb1df623a4ce168af24956102e3947133",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Style: Rounded",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Circular"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "395a6c4684afa960758322ddb6f28928d337d60756f55efa46647d888ff908c7",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Weight: Medium",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Circular"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "ffc20b7c9ef5150699081ba79dc784e2665e2bb58ef13180cbe51975266334d5",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Text size: 12 pt (40mm), 12.5 pt (41mm), 13 pt (44mm), 14.5 pt (45mm/49mm)",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Circular"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "356db7497dbd68d7ce0c765e36624a972b6d2f6324fdc846b336e3757a14af09",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Text size: 34.5 pt (40mm), 36.5 pt (41mm), 36.5 pt (44mm), 41 pt (45mm/49mm)",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Circular"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "704336a0c8189a1fdcb9e2e67c43c278594b5f3a13eb7f2caf33902f1b82d1c4",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Style: Rounded",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Corner"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "395a6c4684afa960758322ddb6f28928d337d60756f55efa46647d888ff908c7",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Weight: Semibold",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Corner"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "d2601d352f9d1d9d4f25d8057fda81d4560c4cc20f0e6f6b422b0e8b6091b1ca",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Text size: 10 pt (40mm), 10.5 pt (41mm), 11 pt (44mm), 12 pt (45mm/49mm)",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Corner"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "943e7ace6d2ac1db8935f8a0bfac3b11798c39ce6e5969eb932be21dbc3eb464",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "By supplying background color or content that communicates information or aids in recognition",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Rectangular"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "ff34ca6d6f6ff8a8958132e9b899034b55e70612e5d9a5366660fc32e3a1868b",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "By using intents to specify relevancy, and help ensure that your widget is displayed in the Smart Stack at",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Rectangular"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "fad48c7b00f333340ee4d0861189ce8b35a98f994f4dae59954bd236fcbfdebd",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "By creating a custom layout of your information that is optimized for the Smart Stack",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Rectangular"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b7f546b62a5aaccf8add43d83eba4f10d0c9eda9aaadfd03abff8e4e7b533ee4",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Style: Rounded",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Rectangular"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "395a6c4684afa960758322ddb6f28928d337d60756f55efa46647d888ff908c7",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Weight: Medium",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Rectangular"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "ffc20b7c9ef5150699081ba79dc784e2665e2bb58ef13180cbe51975266334d5",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Text size: 16.5 pt (40mm), 17.5 pt (41mm), 18 pt (44mm), 19.5 pt (45mm/49mm)",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Rectangular"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "eb1833c69c9fe497513ea5622725f5040abb5116a1a5155e772d7c103ae2c384",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Circular small",
      "section_path": [
        "Complications",
        "Legacy templates",
        "Circular small"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "3daf8c6d3a909ebaec5069af69387f10d08ee335f1237bb5d8e1d888baa56a88",
      "word_count": 2
    },
